Events and Conditions:

|Event ID|Event/Condition          |Description                                                        |
|--------|-------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------|
|E-01    |Delivery Request Received|A new delivery task is assigned to the robot while it is idle.     |
|E-02    |Obstacle Detected        |An obstacle is sensed in the robot's path during navigation.       |
|E-03    |Obstacle Avoided         |The robot has successfully maneuvered around the detected obstacle.|
|E-04    |Destination Reached      |The robot arrives at the delivery destination.                     |
|E-05    |Delivery Successful      |The package has been handed off / delivered at the destination.    |
|E-06    |Critical Battery         |Battery level drops below the safe operating threshold.            |
|E-07    |Warehouse Reached        |The robot arrives back at the warehouse.                           |
